        <h1 class="gradient-text">Cosmetics & Personal Care Aerosols: The Complete Formulation Guide</h1>
        <div class="post-meta">
          <span class="avatar">AK</span>
          <span>By <strong>Absar Khan</strong></span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Aerosol Formulation Specialist</span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
